      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "行，那你先开场，今天头条里有几个我觉得挺值得展开聊聊的。",
      "start": 17.332,
      "duration": 4.571,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，头一个就够有看头的——DeepMind搞了个全球首个\"双盲\"AI评测，你听说了吗？",
      "start": 22.308,
      "duration": 7.619,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "听说了。我早上看到这个新闻的第一反应就是：早该这么干了。",
      "start": 30.36,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "就是！你知道现在大模型评测圈有多乱吗？每次新模型出来，榜单分数刷刷往上涨，但用户拿过来用一用，发现根本不是那么回事。",
      "start": 35.745,
      "duration": 11.102,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，这就是典型的\"基准污染\"问题。说白了就是模型方拿着测试集\"应试调优\"，分数是漂亮，但实际能力根本对不上号。",
      "start": 47.309,
      "duration": 11.799,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "嗯，而且有些厂商甚至会针对特定榜单专门调模型，有点像咱们上学那会儿刷题库刷出来的\"考试机器\"，换套卷子就露馅。",
      "start": 59.559,
      "duration": 10.797,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，这个\"双盲\"机制的关键就在两个\"盲\"——第三方出题，模型方提交之后看不到测试集。这下就没法针对性刷榜了。",
      "start": 70.856,
      "duration": 9.143,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对，而且评的时候模型方也不知道自己被谁评、怎么评，杜绝了\"打招呼\"的可能性。",
      "start": 80.437,
      "duration": 7.01,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这其实是基础设施级的创新你想想，评测是整个AGI竞赛的\"裁判\"，裁判不公正，比赛再热闹也没意义。",
      "start": 87.908,
      "duration": 10.231,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "没错如果双盲能成为行业标准，以后大家看榜单就能直接比较真实能力，而不是各种花式刷分。",
      "start": 98.584,
      "duration": 8.925,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这也意味着一些靠\"刷榜\"博眼球的厂商会很难受，但对认真做技术的团队是大利好。",
      "start": 107.983,
      "duration": 7.445,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "真的假的，我已经开始期待下一轮盲测结果了。",
      "start": 115.855,
      "duration": 3.439,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_015_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "慢慢等吧，这种机制要推开需要时间，但方向肯定是对的。",
      "start": 119.758,
      "duration": 4.659,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_016_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "说到这儿，今天第二个头条也很有亮点——OpenAI跟NVIDIA联合发布了GPT-6 Astra Ultrafast，跑在Blackwell GPU上。",
      "start": 124.834,
      "duration": 10.773,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_017_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这名字起得挺有意思，\"Ultrafast\"——超快版，专门主打极致推理速度。",
      "start": 136.043,
      "duration": 7.14,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_018_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对，我看到新闻说这个版本不是简单的软件升级，而是OpenAI和NVIDIA一起做的\"模型×硬件协同设计\"。",
