      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对，那咱们继续看快讯。第一个，Gemini给3.7和3.6 Flash，还有3.5 Flash-Lite加了个新能力——Agentic视频理解。",
