      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，你理解得很准确。问题是训练的时候经常出现有些专家累死、有些专家闲死的情况，资源浪费严重。",
      "start": 335.639,
      "duration": 8.533,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_040_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那这个Global-batch load balance就是让负载尽量均衡一点？",
