      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_043_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "是的，这对MoE训练效率是个挺实在的提升。第三个快讯是Gemini 3.5 Transcribe全面升级。",
